# Source of truth

GitHub is the source of truth for application code, migrations, configuration, documentation, tests, and CI/CD.

The hosted Supabase database and Vercel deployment are not the source of truth.

All database schema changes must be Supabase migration files under `supabase/migrations/`.

Do not edit the production schema in the Supabase dashboard as the normal process.

Production migrations are applied by GitHub Actions from `main`, not by hand.

Do daily work on `develop`. Pushes to `develop` migrate the development database only.

Never apply `develop` to the production Supabase project. Never use production database secrets on `develop`.

Never reuse Fisheries Quota Exchange Supabase project IDs or the FQX Vercel project. Same accounts, separate projects.

Do not use local Supabase or Vercel CLI as the normal process. Migrations run in GitHub Actions.

Update documentation when architecture changes.
